IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `cat-domain`

-- Shared people, cats and calendars for the tests modules. No assertions.
--
-- Calendar facts used below (checked against a calendar, not computed by
-- the encoding): 2025-10-04 Sat; 2025-12-01 Mon; 2025-12-05 Fri;
-- 2025-12-24 Wed; 2025-12-25 Thu; 2025-12-26 Fri; 2025-12-29 Mon;
-- 2026-01-01 Thu; 2026-03-01 Sun; 2026-03-02 Mon; 2026-03-06 Fri.
-- The holiday list is a TEST INPUT standing in for the WA calendar: Christmas
-- Day, Boxing Day, New Year's Day, Australia Day, Labour Day (WA, first Monday
-- in March) and Good Friday 2026.

§ `Fixtures`

GIVETH A LIST OF DATE
`WA holidays 2025-26` MEANS
    LIST YMD 2025 12 25, YMD 2025 12 26, YMD 2026 1 1, YMD 2026 1 26, YMD 2026 3 2, YMD 2026 4 3

GIVETH A LIST OF DATE
`no holidays` MEANS EMPTY

§§ `People`

GIVEN name        IS A STRING
      dob         IS A DATE
      convictions IS A LIST OF Conviction
GIVETH A Person
`a person named` name `born` dob `convicted` convictions MEANS
    Person WITH
        `name`                               IS name
        `date of birth`                      IS dob
        `parents or guardians`               IS EMPTY
        `resident in the State since`        IS YMD 2000 1 1
        `convictions`                        IS convictions
        `infringement notices under the Act` IS EMPTY
        `an eligible pensioner`              IS FALSE
        `current memberships`                IS EMPTY
        `a veterinarian`                     IS FALSE
        `a veterinary nurse`                 IS FALSE
        `units of competency completed`      IS EMPTY
        `courses completed`                  IS EMPTY
        `holds an approval to breed cats`    IS FALSE

`Alex` MEANS `a person named` "Alex" `born` (YMD 1980 1 1) `convicted` EMPTY

-- A child of 13 whose guardian is Carl (s 4(1)(c)).
`Bea` MEANS Person WITH
    `name`                               IS "Bea"
    `date of birth`                      IS YMD 2012 6 1
    `parents or guardians`               IS LIST "Carl"
    `resident in the State since`        IS YMD 2012 6 1
    `convictions`                        IS EMPTY
    `infringement notices under the Act` IS EMPTY
    `an eligible pensioner`              IS FALSE
    `current memberships`                IS EMPTY
    `a veterinarian`                     IS FALSE
    `a veterinary nurse`                 IS FALSE
    `units of competency completed`      IS EMPTY
    `courses completed`                  IS EMPTY
    `holds an approval to breed cats`    IS FALSE

`Carl` MEANS `a person named` "Carl" `born` (YMD 1975 3 3) `convicted` EMPTY

-- A person who arrived in the State on 20 November 2025.
`Newcomer` MEANS Person WITH
    `name`                               IS "Newcomer"
    `date of birth`                      IS YMD 1990 5 5
    `parents or guardians`               IS EMPTY
    `resident in the State since`        IS YMD 2025 11 20
    `convictions`                        IS EMPTY
    `infringement notices under the Act` IS EMPTY
    `an eligible pensioner`              IS FALSE
    `current memberships`                IS EMPTY
    `a veterinarian`                     IS FALSE
    `a veterinary nurse`                 IS FALSE
    `units of competency completed`      IS EMPTY
    `courses completed`                  IS EMPTY
    `holds an approval to breed cats`    IS FALSE

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      a IS A `Written law`
GIVETH A Conviction
`a conviction on` d `under` a MEANS
    Conviction WITH `date of the conviction` IS d, `offence against` IS a, `instrument` IS `the Act itself`

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      a IS A `Written law`
GIVETH A Conviction
`a regulation conviction on` d `under` a MEANS
    Conviction WITH `date of the conviction` IS d, `offence against` IS a, `instrument` IS `subsidiary legislation made under it`

GIVEN name      IS A STRING
      pensioner IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A Person
`an adult named` name `, a pensioner:` pensioner MEANS
    Person WITH
        `name`                               IS name
        `date of birth`                      IS YMD 1950 1 1
        `parents or guardians`               IS EMPTY
        `resident in the State since`        IS YMD 1970 1 1
        `convictions`                        IS EMPTY
        `infringement notices under the Act` IS EMPTY
        `an eligible pensioner`              IS pensioner
        `current memberships`                IS EMPTY
        `a veterinarian`                     IS FALSE
        `a veterinary nurse`                 IS FALSE
        `units of competency completed`      IS EMPTY
        `courses completed`                  IS EMPTY
        `holds an approval to breed cats`    IS FALSE

GIVEN name        IS A STRING
      memberships IS A LIST OF `Cat fancy body`
      convictions IS A LIST OF Conviction
      notices     IS A LIST OF `Infringement notice record`
      approved    IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A Person
`a breeder named` name `, member of` memberships `, convicted` convictions `, noticed` notices `, approved:` approved MEANS
    Person WITH
        `name`                               IS name
        `date of birth`                      IS YMD 1985 2 2
        `parents or guardians`               IS EMPTY
        `resident in the State since`        IS YMD 1985 2 2
        `convictions`                        IS convictions
        `infringement notices under the Act` IS notices
        `an eligible pensioner`              IS FALSE
        `current memberships`                IS memberships
        `a veterinarian`                     IS FALSE
        `a veterinary nurse`                 IS FALSE
        `units of competency completed`      IS EMPTY
        `courses completed`                  IS EMPTY
        `holds an approval to breed cats`    IS approved

GIVEN vet   IS A BOOLEAN
      nurse IS A BOOLEAN
      units IS A LIST OF STRING
      courses IS A LIST OF STRING
GIVETH A Person
`an implanter: vet` vet `, nurse` nurse `, units` units `, courses` courses MEANS
    Person WITH
        `name`                               IS "Implanter"
        `date of birth`                      IS YMD 1980 1 1
        `parents or guardians`               IS EMPTY
        `resident in the State since`        IS YMD 1980 1 1
        `convictions`                        IS EMPTY
        `infringement notices under the Act` IS EMPTY
        `an eligible pensioner`              IS FALSE
        `current memberships`                IS EMPTY
        `a veterinarian`                     IS vet
        `a veterinary nurse`                 IS nurse
        `units of competency completed`      IS units
        `courses completed`                  IS courses
        `holds an approval to breed cats`    IS FALSE

`the vet` MEANS `an implanter: vet` TRUE `, nurse` FALSE `, units` EMPTY `, courses` EMPTY

§§ `Things done to cats`

GIVEN implanter IS A Person
      day       IS A DATE
GIVETH AN `Implanted device`
`a compliant microchip implanted by` implanter `on` day MEANS
    `Implanted device` WITH
        `capable of being implanted in a cat`                        IS TRUE
        `designed to record information that can be electronically retrieved` IS TRUE
        `complies with AS 5018-2001`                                 IS TRUE
        `complies with AS 5019-2001`                                 IS TRUE
        `implanted by`                                               IS implanter
        `date implanted`                                             IS day

GIVEN day IS A DATE
GIVETH A `Sterilising procedure`
`a desexing by a vet on` day MEANS
    `Sterilising procedure` WITH
        `made permanently infertile by a surgical procedure` IS TRUE
        `performed by a veterinarian`                        IS TRUE
        `date performed`                                     IS day

`a vet certificate` MEANS
    `Veterinary certificate` WITH
        `given by a veterinarian`                                          IS TRUE
        `states the procedure may adversely affect the cat's health and welfare` IS TRUE

GIVEN who   IS A Person
      start IS A DATE
GIVETH A Keeping
`kept by` who `since` start MEANS
    Keeping WITH `keeper` IS who, `since` IS start, `through a business or organisation` IS FALSE

GIVEN lg    IS A STRING
      owner IS A STRING
      term  IS A `Registration term`
      start IS A DATE
GIVETH A Registration
`registered with` lg `to` owner `for` term `from` start MEANS
    Registration WITH
        `local government` IS lg
        `registered owner` IS owner
        `term`             IS term
        `has effect from`  IS start
        `cancelled on`     IS NOTHING

§§ `Cats`

-- The general cat: born on dob, ordinarily kept in Perth, kept by the
-- keepings given, with the registration, device and desexing given, and no
-- certificates, custodian, foster placement or breeding purpose.
GIVEN dob        IS A DATE
      keepings   IS A LIST OF Keeping
      reg        IS A MAYBE Registration
      dev        IS A MAYBE `Implanted device`
      sp         IS A MAYBE `Sterilising procedure`
GIVETH A Cat
`a Perth cat born` dob `kept by` keepings `registered` reg `chipped` dev `desexed` sp MEANS
    Cat WITH
        `name`                                     IS "Tom"
        `date of birth`                            IS dob
        `district where ordinarily kept`           IS "City of Perth"
        `kept in the State`                        IS TRUE
        `date of death`                            IS NOTHING
        `registration`                             IS reg
        `registered with another local government since` IS FALSE
        `implanted device`                         IS dev
        `sterilising procedure`                    IS sp
        `certificate against microchipping`        IS NOTHING
        `certificate against sterilisation`        IS NOTHING
        `keepings`                                 IS keepings
        `name recorded as owner in a microchip database` IS NOTHING
        `custodian`                                IS NOTHING
        `foster placement`                         IS NOTHING
        `owned for the purpose of breeding`        IS FALSE
        `sterilisation tattoo on the ear`          IS FALSE

-- Alex's adult cat (born 1 Jan 2024), kept since 2024, chipped and desexed
-- in 2024, with no registration.
`Alex's unregistered cat` MEANS
    `a Perth cat born` (YMD 2024 1 1) `kept by` (LIST `kept by` `Alex` `since` (YMD 2024 3 1))
        `registered` NOTHING
        `chipped` (JUST (`a compliant microchip implanted by` `the vet` `on` (YMD 2024 3 1)))
        `desexed` (JUST (`a desexing by a vet on` (YMD 2024 3 1)))

-- The same cat, registered with the City of Perth for one year from 1 Nov 2025.
`Alex's registered cat` MEANS
    `a Perth cat born` (YMD 2024 1 1) `kept by` (LIST `kept by` `Alex` `since` (YMD 2024 3 1))
        `registered` (JUST (`registered with` "City of Perth" `to` "Alex" `for` `one year` `from` (YMD 2025 11 1)))
        `chipped` (JUST (`a compliant microchip implanted by` `the vet` `on` (YMD 2024 3 1)))
        `desexed` (JUST (`a desexing by a vet on` (YMD 2024 3 1)))

-- A kitten born 31 August 2025, kept by Alex since 1 October 2025, neither
-- chipped nor desexed.
`the August kitten` MEANS
    `a Perth cat born` (YMD 2025 8 31) `kept by` (LIST `kept by` `Alex` `since` (YMD 2025 10 1))
        `registered` NOTHING `chipped` NOTHING `desexed` NOTHING
